# URL the dashboard fetches listings.json from. Point this at the raw
# GitHub URL for your fork's data branch so the daily Action's commits show
# up without requiring a redeploy:
#
#   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/<owner>/<repo>/<branch>/data/listings.json
#
# Leave unset to fall back to the bundled snapshot in public/data/listings.json
# (useful for local development or if you'd rather redeploy on every refresh).
NEXT_PUBLIC_DATA_URL=
